  "title": "Introducing Glommio, a thread-per-core crate for Rust and Linux",
  "summary": "Glommio (pronounced glom-io or |glomjəʊ|) is a cooperative thread-per-core crate for Rust & Linux based on io_uring. It allows you to write asynchronous code that takes advantage of rust async/await, but it doesn’t use helper threads anywhere.",
